{"4289310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ABIDE", "steam_appid": 4289310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ABIDE</strong> is a first-person psychological horror game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are staying at the St Boniface retreat situated in the secluded and idyllic countryside. There are mysteries here. <strong>Gruesome mysteries</strong>. By pushing your luck and venturing out past your curfew you can discover the disturbing horrors within this house and within its residents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4289310/extras/1ad0250de62375a7ca2cfdc755cbd4be.avif?t=1779711967\" width=1234 height=282 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>ABIDE</strong> has a <strong>day/night cycle. </strong>The daytime is all about <strong>investigation</strong> and relationship-building. By day you will be doing a variety of tasks with the unhinged residents of your choosing. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Actions in the daytime will inform what you do in the night time.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4289310/extras/b02a22369a942cb14b020fbde53a0d64.poster.avif?t=1779711967\" width=1170 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4289310/extras/b02a22369a942cb14b020fbde53a0d64.webm?t=1779711967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4289310/extras/b02a22369a942cb14b020fbde53a0d64.mp4?t=1779711967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night time is all about <strong>horror</strong>. At night you can <strong>sneak about</strong> and go places and do things you shouldn't. During the day the uneasy setting and the odd NPCs create intrigue and tension which evolves into terror as the day turns to night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4289310/extras/eb0334c64f773382c440cc5c07bcdece.poster.avif?t=1779711967\" width=1170 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4289310/extras/eb0334c64f773382c440cc5c07bcdece.webm?t=1779711967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4289310/extras/eb0334c64f773382c440cc5c07bcdece.mp4?t=1779711967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Storyline</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The retreat in <strong>ABIDE </strong>has an eccentric cast of criminals, creeps and lost souls. Each character has been identified as having a need for rehabilitation, whatever that might mean... The mystery of the game is discovering the <i>intricacies </i>of the clients and unfolding their dirty laundry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4289310/extras/3ff2282a62011f1e59aa7a53df509eaf.poster.avif?t=1779711967\" width=1032 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4289310/extras/3ff2282a62011f1e59aa7a53df509eaf.webm?t=1779711967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4289310/extras/3ff2282a62011f1e59aa7a53df509eaf.mp4?t=1779711967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Art Style</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the third stop motion game from the <strong>Talha &amp; Jack Co</strong> studio. They are continuing to push what can be done with stop motion and interactivity. <strong>ABIDE </strong>has their most detailed and expressive models so far, with magnetised, swappable parts, robust armatures and experiments with new materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of their dolls are meticulously handcrafted following ball-jointed <i>art doll </i>techniques, expertly painted using modelling acrylics and are truly unique pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4289310/extras/7f96b6bf2e24a7dfa7b40a0e03417713.avif?t=1779711967\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4289310/extras_big/7f96b6bf2e24a7dfa7b40a0e03417713.avif?t=1779711967 width=1560 height=576 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ABIDE</strong> is a first-person psychological horror game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are staying at the St Boniface retreat situated in the secluded and idyllic countryside. There are mysteries here. <strong>Gruesome mysteries</strong>. By pushing your luck and venturing out past your curfew you can discover the disturbing horrors within this house and within its residents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4289310/extras/1ad0250de62375a7ca2cfdc755cbd4be.avif?t=1779711967\" width=1234 height=282 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>ABIDE</strong> has a <strong>day/night cycle. </strong>The daytime is all about <strong>investigation</strong> and relationship-building. By day you will be doing a variety of tasks with the unhinged residents of your choosing. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Actions in the daytime will inform what you do in the night time.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4289310/extras/b02a22369a942cb14b020fbde53a0d64.poster.avif?t=1779711967\" width=1170 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4289310/extras/b02a22369a942cb14b020fbde53a0d64.webm?t=1779711967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4289310/extras/b02a22369a942cb14b020fbde53a0d64.mp4?t=1779711967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night time is all about <strong>horror</strong>. At night you can <strong>sneak about</strong> and go places and do things you shouldn't. During the day the uneasy setting and the odd NPCs create intrigue and tension which evolves into terror as the day turns to night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4289310/extras/eb0334c64f773382c440cc5c07bcdece.poster.avif?t=1779711967\" width=1170 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4289310/extras/eb0334c64f773382c440cc5c07bcdece.webm?t=1779711967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4289310/extras/eb0334c64f773382c440cc5c07bcdece.mp4?t=1779711967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Storyline</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The retreat in <strong>ABIDE </strong>has an eccentric cast of criminals, creeps and lost souls. Each character has been identified as having a need for rehabilitation, whatever that might mean... The mystery of the game is discovering the <i>intricacies </i>of the clients and unfolding their dirty laundry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4289310/extras/3ff2282a62011f1e59aa7a53df509eaf.poster.avif?t=1779711967\" width=1032 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4289310/extras/3ff2282a62011f1e59aa7a53df509eaf.webm?t=1779711967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4289310/extras/3ff2282a62011f1e59aa7a53df509eaf.mp4?t=1779711967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Art Style</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the third stop motion game from the <strong>Talha &amp; Jack Co</strong> studio. They are continuing to push what can be done with stop motion and interactivity. <strong>ABIDE </strong>has their most detailed and expressive models so far, with magnetised, swappable parts, robust armatures and experiments with new materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of their dolls are meticulously handcrafted following ball-jointed <i>art doll </i>techniques, expertly painted using modelling acrylics and are truly unique pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4289310/extras/7f96b6bf2e24a7dfa7b40a0e03417713.avif?t=1779711967\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4289310/extras_big/7f96b6bf2e24a7dfa7b40a0e03417713.avif?t=1779711967 width=1560 height=576 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "ABIDE is a psychological first person horror game using prosthetic gore effects, stop motion and dolls scanned into 3D models. A peaceful retreat where people go to get better. A place for people to air their demons.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4289310/168e50d4acf339391f00758fb6a7ae804284b666/header.jpg?t=1779711967", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4289310/461158116951f972616c306c517ce7b9ab738196/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779711967", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4289310/461158116951f972616c306c517ce7b9ab738196/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1779711967", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> CPU: SSE2 instruction set support<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Graphics card: DX9 (shader model 3.0) or DX11 with feature level 9.3 capabilities<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> CPU: SSE2 instruction set support<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Graphics card: DX9 (shader model 3.0) or DX11 with feature level 9.3 capabilities<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> High Sierra 10.13+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Metal capable Intel and AMD GPUs<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong